# fixes: F2 F5
# final_snapshot skips a workspace whose jj workspace is already forgotten
# (an earlier pipeline got past its forget): there is no working copy to
# record into, so neither a NotLoaded error nor a rollback to `active`.
<<<
       \/ dir /\ handle /\ Goto(p, "forget")
          /\ UNCHANGED <<dbState, mem, tracked, lock, failLeft>>
       \/ dir /\ handle /\ RollBack(1) /\ Exit(p)
       \/ dir /\ ~handle /\ RollBack(0) /\ Exit(p)
===
       \/ dir /\ ~jjws /\ Goto(p, "forget")
          /\ UNCHANGED <<dbState, mem, tracked, lock, failLeft>>
       \/ dir /\ jjws /\ handle /\ Goto(p, "forget")
          /\ UNCHANGED <<dbState, mem, tracked, lock, failLeft>>
       \/ dir /\ jjws /\ handle /\ RollBack(1) /\ Exit(p)
       \/ dir /\ jjws /\ ~handle /\ RollBack(0) /\ Exit(p)
>>>
